e-review.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-18-handoff-pose-b06-source-coverage-closeout.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-16-decision-log-module-metadata-discovery-invalidates-review-provenance.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-27-handoff-delegated-rounds-legacy-status.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-28-handoff-delegated-conclusions-round4.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-14-decision-log-adr-shared-worktree-runtime-review.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-09-12-note-cli-output-design-taxonomy.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-13-decision-log-review-assurance-requires-cryptographic-proof.md\n.pose/knowledge/README.md\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-13-decision-log-adr-component-aware-review-plans-review.md\n.pose/workflows/review.md\n.pose/specs/2026-11-23-pose-review-run-reaps-lingering-reviewer-processes.md\n.pose/templates/knowledge.md\n.pose/results/b01-action-independent-knowledge-check.log\n.pose/specs/2026-08-15-pose-knowledge-durable-reference-type.md\n.pose/specs/2026-07-18-pose-knowledge-consumption-traceability.md\n.pose/changelogs/v0.9.0/pose-knowledge-consumption-traceability.md\n.pose/changelogs/v1.3.0/pose-knowledge-durable-reference-type.md\n.pose/adr/2026-08-15-durable-non-architectural-knowledge-belongs-in-rules-not-a-new-type.md\n.pose/adr/2026-07-19-knowledge-consumption-refs-and-advisory-retrieval.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
