e plan says no producer exists; a recommended tool you did not run is `not-used` with a `rationale`; (h) the `evidence` of a tool is `<class>:<ref>`: when the tool lists evidence classes, a ref of one of them that the bundle sealed (listed under Sealed evidence), otherwise `command:` followed by the command you ran; a bare command line is refused; (i) a draft that approves leaves no finding open: each finding is either a follow-up with `action`, `owner` and `review_by`, which is recorded as an accepted risk, or the draft requests changes; a finding without them is open and the approval is refused.\"\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_conclusions.go:228:\tdiffer = append(differ, differingItems(\"criterion\", mappingsByDelta(att.Criteria), mappingsByDelta(want.Criteria))...)\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_conclusions.go:237:// mappingsByDelta is criteria with each one's mappings ordered by delta: the\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_conclusions.go:239:func mappingsByDelta(criteria []ReviewCriterion) []ReviewCriterion {\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_seal_readiness.go:39:\t// asks for mappings, every declared decision must be usable as one.\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_conclusions.go:228:\tdiffer = append(differ, differingItems(\"criterion\", mappingsByDelta(att.Criteria), mappingsByDelta(want.Criteria))...)\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_conclusions.go:237:// mappingsByDelta is criteria with each one's mappings ordered by delta: the\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_conclusions.go:239:func mappingsByDelta(criteria []ReviewCriterion) []ReviewCriterion {\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_rounds.go:70:\t// as `--criterion` mappings do; the writer's gate judges them (review\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_rounds.go:72:\tMappings []ReviewCriterionMapping `json:\"mappings,omitempty\"`\npose-mcp/internal/pose/causality_closeout.go:99:// declares, keyed by the bare ID mappings use.\npose-mcp/internal/pose/causality_closeout.go:150:\t\t\tblockers = append(blockers, \"criterion \"+id+\" i